  <note id="rk23Notes">
    <content>
      <p>RK23 was frozen before model fitting. The Boël cross-protein, non-synonymous ordinal expression data contain 6,348 rows split into 5,079 train, 635 dev and 634 test constructs; dev and test each contain 556 operational protein clusters. Inference uses 20,000 protein-cluster bootstrap replicates and 20,000 within-cluster paired-prediction exchange permutations.</p>
      <p>For the pre-registered combined-feature contrast, logistic base Spearman is 0.12323866964334065 and augmented Spearman is 0.12858011330132996; the gain is 0.005341443657989303 with interval -0.028391217548145335 to 0.03877199494833087. Logistic base MSE is 4.3315785679697285 and augmented MSE is 4.331129372215796. Logistic MSE improvement is 0.0004491957539327629 with interval -0.05805847621001278 to 0.05902495012966774. Both Holm-adjusted p values are 1.0.</p>
      <p>HistGB base Spearman is 0.20578582778335267 and augmented Spearman is 0.20073508224367628; the gain is -0.005050745539676382 with interval -0.03822624688088306 to 0.02788614599173979. HistGB base MSE is 4.297686306611763 and augmented MSE is 4.326145966453431. HistGB MSE improvement is -0.028459659841668206 with interval -0.13056306283760102 to 0.07304107234596917. Both Holm-adjusted p values are 1.0.</p>
      <p>Independent test verification passed 275 of 275 checks after independent refitting and complete train, dev and test prediction, metric, bootstrap and permutation reconstruction; all maximum differences were zero. Development verification passed 177 of 177 checks. The simple-feature HistGB contrast gives descriptive test Spearman gain 0.061363979686494485 and MSE improvement 0.1807573553811137, but it is outside the primary Holm family and does not alter the negative primary decision.</p>
      <p>All four primary endpoints fail, so the protein-OOD initiation-structure increment is not supported. This is not fixed-protein synonymous OOD, velocity, decay, functional untouched, CodonFlow-RK or SOTA evidence. RK-G1 remains false and generator training remains unauthorized (frozen test evidence commit a180c596b42f187ae46d6bd8d3607f1d2f2acb4d; closeout commit 7ed4cdbb6ff74b4761bdab355cb460252bae09cd).</p>
    </content>
  </note>
